 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
 
+## Board publication
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board. Only account admins (including owners) with access to the board can do this. Returns `201 Created` with the board JSON, including its `public_url`. Publishing an already published board keeps the same link.
+
+Visitors can open the board at `/public/boards/:key`, its columns at `/public/boards/:key/columns/:id`, and its published cards at `/public/boards/:key/cards/:number`. These HTML pages also accept the board’s account prefix. Drafts are not shared, and publishing does not grant membership or editing access.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board. Requires the same permissions as publishing. Returns `204 No Content`. The old board, column, and card links stop working; publishing again generates a new key.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
